Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Crit Reset Default (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Berserker's Fury, Haas's Claws, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar
- Core: Berserker's Fury, Haas's Claws, Endless Battle
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Fatal, Seasoned Hunter, War Cry
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy draft lacks reliable knockdown control and shorter Finch Poise cycles matter more than tenacity.; Immortality over Malefic Roar when Use for final Lord fights when one revive protects Ling's wall exit better than another armor-piercing damage slot.; Rose Gold Meteor over Malefic Roar when Use against magic burst that can catch Ling after Tempest of Blades ends but before he reaches the next wall.
- Total cost: 12510 gold

Default jungle setup for crit-reset fights where Ling farms Berserker's Fury and Haas's Claws, then uses Endless Battle procs through Defiant Sword.

### Snowball Execute (Jungle)

- Items: Magic Boots, Sky Piercer, Berserker's Fury, Haas's Claws, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair
- Core: Sky Piercer, Berserker's Fury, Haas's Claws
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Fatal, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Flame Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Magic Boots when Use when early kills are available but enemy CC can knock Ling off a wall before he cashes Sky Piercer stacks.; Malefic Roar over Blade of Despair when Use when tanks buy armor early and the execute threshold is not reachable through raw attack alone.; Immortality over Blade of Despair when Use once Sky Piercer stacks are valuable enough that shutdown protection beats the last burst slot.
- Total cost: 11960 gold

High-risk snowball setup for games where Ling can score early side-lane kills, protect Sky Piercer stacks, and end before grouped control shuts down wall dives.

### Anti-Armor Objective (Jungle)

