- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Haas's Claws over Sea Halberd when Use when the enemy lacks heavy healing or shielding and Ling needs crit sustain more than anti-regen pressure.; Blade of Despair over Immortality when Use when Ling is ahead, the enemy backline is still reachable, and the game can end before one revive is needed.; Wind of Nature over Immortality when Use against physical burst carries when a timed damage immunity saves Ling's post-ultimate landing better than a delayed revive.
- Total cost: 11650 gold

Anti-armor setup for objective fights where Ling must still threaten carries while cutting through high-defense front liners and sustain supports.

